- A **short** reach out of the start key at 0.5 s makes Title start moving quickly.
- A **long** reach into the landing key at 1.5 s makes it settle in softly.
- Keep the landing handle **along the bottom** of the graph. If you drag it upward, Title arrives still moving instead of coming to rest.

